     "\r\n  \r\n\r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n    Dear all,<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    this week I came accross a relatively important bug in the\r\n    `variogram()` function.<br>\r\n    In a few minutes I will be uploading the v0.10-13 that fixes this.<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    It affects the calculation of the variograms under **some**\r\n    circunstances.<br>\r\n    Specifically, when there are many *holes* in the field, it was\r\n    treating the empty spaces as **observations with a value of 0**. <br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    The problem **does not affect** in any way the results of the models\r\n    fitted with `remlf90()`.<br>\r\n    So your results are correct and reliable.<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    However, you might want to recompute your variograms, and revise the\r\n    modelling decisions based on them.<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    To give you an idea of the impact on the variograms, consider this\r\n    fairly rectangular trial:<br>\r\n    <img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/breedr/attach/8260d2649c0f3/bgheahbb.png?part=0.1.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"\"><br>\r\n    As you see, the variograms computed **before** and **after** the fix\r\n    are very similar (apart from the scaling).<br>\r\n    <img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/breedr/attach/8260d2649c0f3/ibibhaeh.png?part=0.1.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/breedr/attach/8260d2649c0f3/jdicbebj.png?part=0.1.3&amp;view=1\" alt=\"\"><br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    On the contrary, this other trial is somewhat a extreme case with\r\n    lots of holes.<br>\r\n    <img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/breedr/attach/8260d2649c0f3/hfghabge.png?part=0.1.4&amp;view=1\" alt=\"\"><br>\r\n    As you can see, the change in the variogram is dramatic.<br>\r\n    <img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/breedr/attach/8260d2649c0f3/efgfbhda.png?part=0.1.5&amp;view=1\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/breedr/attach/8260d2649c0f3/cadaebbe.png?part=0.1.6&amp;view=1\" alt=\"\"><br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    Sorry for the inconvenience.<br>\r\n            ƒacu.-<br>\r\n    <div>-- <br>\r\n      \r\n      \r\n      \r\n      <table width=\"auto\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tbody>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td><a href=\"http://www.inra.fr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.inra.fr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244810023000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0P2pGAOtpGzNTA35WoPUb3\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/breedr/attach/8260d2649c0f3/logo-INRA2012.gif?part=0.1.7&amp;view=1\" alt=\"INRA\" longdesc=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/8W58qshI1EdwH97If0_p9YZdBXkZ4crVqL436HX2TKW2TUPnhw=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.inra.fr\" height=\"60\" width=\"147\" border=\"0\"></a></td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"padding-left:77px\">\r\n              \r\n              <table style=\"border-top:#999 solid 1px;border-bottom:#999 solid 1px\" width=\"auto\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td height=\"10\"> </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\"><font face=\"Arial,\r\n                        Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\" color=\"#8bac21\"><strong>Facundo\r\n                          MUÑOZ</strong></font></td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\"><font face=\"Arial,\r\n                        Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\" color=\"#000000\"><strong>Postdoctoral\r\n                          Statistician</strong></font></td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td height=\"30\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"left\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\" color=\"#8bac21\"><a href sty